(text "UART bus A: Mega Serial2 (TX2 D16 via 1k, RX2 D17) -> PDN/UART of DRV1-3 (addr 0,1,2).\nUART bus B: Mega Serial3 (TX3 D14 via 1k, RX3 D15) -> DRV4-5. Gives per-joint load (StallGuard), temperature and open-wire flags." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 375.92 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 230c2d92-f7ba-41a8-b60c-bce15ff4b0c7))
